AltoConvexCreditLineMarket::emergencyExitConvex()
├── when caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
├── when PAUSE_TYPE is not active
│   ├── when market is active
│   │   └── it should revert with AltoConvexCreditLineMustBePaused
│   └── when only FROZEN_TYPE is active
│       └── it should revert with AltoConvexCreditLineMustBePaused
├── when Convex strategy is already inactive
│   └── it should revert with AltoConvexCreditLineStrategyInactive
├── when Convex strategy is inactive and PAUSE_TYPE is not active
│   └── it should revert with AltoConvexCreditLineMustBePaused before checking strategy status
├── given market is paused and staked collateral is zero
│   ├── it should not call withdrawAndUnwrap
│   ├── it should preserve any raw LP already idle in the market
│   ├── it should mark Convex inactive
│   ├── it should leave Booster collateral allowance at zero
│   ├── it should emit ConvexEmergencyExit with zero
│   └── it should return zero
├── given market is paused and staked collateral is nonzero
│   ├── when reward pool balance query reverts
│   │   └── it should propagate the failure and keep Convex active
│   ├── when withdrawAndUnwrap reverts
│   │   └── it should propagate the failure and keep Convex active
│   ├── when withdrawAndUnwrap returns false
│   │   └── it should revert with AltoConvexCreditLineExternalCallFailed
│   └── when withdrawal succeeds
│       ├── it should call withdrawAndUnwrap for all stake with claim false
│       ├── it should hold all recovered LP idle in the market
│       ├── it should preserve raw LP that was already idle before the exit
│       ├── it should leave reward pool stake at zero when the pool withdraws the reported balance correctly
│       ├── it should mark Convex inactive permanently
│       ├── it should leave Booster collateral allowance at zero
│       ├── it should emit ConvexEmergencyExit with reported staked assets
│       └── it should return reported staked assets
└── given a successful exit
    ├── it should not change creditAccount collateralAssets
    ├── it should not change totalSupply totalBorrowed positions or claimableFeesAssets
    ├── it should not transfer collateral to owner or creditAccount
    ├── it should not claim or forward rewards
    ├── it should make later addCollateral revert because strategy is inactive
    ├── it should allow later removeCollateral to transfer recovered idle LP directly after unpause
    ├── it should not call Convex again during a later collateral removal
    ├── it should make a second emergency exit revert with AltoConvexCreditLineStrategyInactive
    ├── when reported stake is smaller than recorded collateral
    │   └── it should still mark Convex inactive while recorded collateral exceeds recovered idle LP
    └── when reported stake is larger than recorded collateral
        └── it should recover the entire reported stake without increasing recorded collateral
